    },
    {
      "id": "2rUgoMkdTlDa07FvG1u39",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1224.6609579125618,
      "y": 778.9550774236448,
      "width": 647.887451171875,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1503531513,
      "version": 692,
      "versionNonce": 2128660919,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784436895410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Redis keys based on the algorithm\nFixed Window Counter:\nAlice:12:00:00\n\nSliding Log Window:\nUse SortedSet\nKey -> RateLimit:UserId\nScore -> timestamp of the request\nValue -> timestamp:randomString\n\nToken Bucket: (HashSet)\nAlice:bucket -> {\n    tokens: count, \n    last_refill: timestamp\n}\n\nFor the case of token bucket, we'd use a Lua Script to \nRead-Calculate-Update atomically.\n\nMax((time_now - last_refill)*refill_rate + token_count, max_tokens) = curr_tokens\nif curr_tokens > 0: allow request",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Redis keys based on the algorithm\nFixed Window Counter:\nAlice:12:00:00\n\nSliding Log Window:\nUse SortedSet\nKey -> RateLimit:UserId\nScore -> timestamp of the request\nValue -> timestamp:randomString\n\nToken Bucket: (HashSet)\nAlice:bucket -> {\n    tokens: count, \n    last_refill: timestamp\n}\n\nFor the case of token bucket, we'd use a Lua Script to \nRead-Calculate-Update atomically.\n\nMax((time_now - last_refill)*refill_rate + token_count, max_tokens) = curr_tokens\nif curr_tokens > 0: allow request",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_kz8eNXIZysxSxl-hRRuU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 765.2861456040074,
      "y": 636.1580572755936,
      "width": 41.4239501953125,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
